flowchart TB
  T[Tier L: 2+ repos or 2+ decision makers]:::main --> UMB[Umbrella issue + Decisions comment, umbrella.txt, before first PR]:::gate
  UMB --> SPLIT[Critical path: order PRs by what blocks the goal]:::main
  SPLIT --> P1[[PR pipeline M per PR]]:::main
  SPLIT --> P2[[Upstream fix PRs, one per bug]]:::main
  P1 & P2 --> EV([Every event: merge, decision, new PR]):::ext --> UPD[Same step: tick checkbox with state, edit Decisions comment, waiting-on.txt dependents]:::main
  UPD -->|watcher: TRACKER STALE if missed| UPD
  UPD --> SPLIT
